## 🚀 Deploy in 3 Steps

### Step 1: Create GitHub Repo (2 min)
```
1. Go to github.com/new
2. Name: pdf-assistant-rag
3. Make it Public
4. Create Repository
```

### Step 2: Upload Files (3 min)
```
1. Click "Add file" → "Upload files"
2. Upload all files one by one
3. Click "Commit changes" each time
```

### Step 3: Deploy to Streamlit (2 min)
```
1. Go to streamlit.io/cloud
2. Click "Create app"
3. Select your repo
4. Click "Deploy"
5. Wait 3 minutes
6. Done! 🎉
```

