## 💬 FAQ

**Q: Can I use this commercially?**
A: Yes, but ensure Groq API terms are met

**Q: Does it work with all PDFs?**
A: Works with text PDFs; scanned PDFs need OCR

**Q: How many users can I have?**
A: Unlimited; costs scale with Groq usage

**Q: Can I customize the UI?**
A: Yes! Edit app.py and redeploy automatically

**Q: Is my data private?**
A: PDFs aren't logged; API key stays in session

